  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.3 stable: Significant bundle since 1.1.1. Dep-bump to SpawnDev.SIPSorcery 10.0.5 (ResolveHmacKey + RelayPortRange for production TURN, SCTP burst tunables, SctpDataSender race fix). Cross-platform IRTCRtpSender.GetParameters/SetParameters simulcast DTOs (browser via typed BlazorJS wrappers, desktop single-encoding stub). BlazorJS 3.5.5 -> 3.5.6 dep bump for typed RTCRtpSendParameters / RTCSctpTransport. Consumer-facing STUN/TURN server lives in the companion SpawnDev.RTC.Server 1.0.3 (tracker-gated ephemeral credentials, Origin allowlist, period-rotating secrets, NAT port-range support). Production-validated at hub.spawndev.com. See CHANGELOG.md for per-rc breakdown.",
